            "review_title": "Review at Bo De Quan Vegetarian Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Mike46077\nZionsville, Indiana365 contributions\n0\nVegetarian/Vegan Buffet for local flavor\nJan 2023\nthis is a vegan/vegetarian restaurant with a wide variety of dishes served buffet style. We went with a guide as part of a larger evening tour and he explained all of the food to us. Without a guide you may be guessing what each dish actually is, but it all tastes good. No worries about accidently eating meat. There are a lot of Mock Meats (which are important for cultural reasons). Definitely a place to come if you are vegan.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 12, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
